 "answer": "CD-10421: Customer Inquiry\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding your recent charge. As per our policy, charges made more than 30 days prior are not eligible for refunds. However, since your charge was made exactly 29 days ago, it falls within the 30-day eligibility window.\n\nTo proceed with the refund, please follow these steps:\n\n1. Log into your account and navigate to the \"My Account\" section.\n2. Click on \"Manage Orders.\"\n3. Locate your order and click on the \"View Details\" button.\n4. Under the \"Status\" tab, ensure the charge is marked as \"Charged.\"\n\nOnce confirmed, a billing specialist will review your case and initiate the refund process. You will receive an update via",
